---
import PortfolioFooter from "../components/PortfolioFooter.astro";
import PortfolioHeader from "../components/PortfolioHeader.astro";
import CloudflareAnalytics from "../components/CloudflareAnalytics.astro";
import "../styles/portfolio.css";
const nameWords = [
  [
    { letter: "r", photo: 7, position: "53% 100%", size: "auto 115%" },
    { letter: "y", photo: 6, position: "48% 100%", size: "auto 150%" },
    { letter: "a", photo: 2, position: "50% 36%", size: "cover" },
    { letter: "n", photo: 5, position: "0% 75%", size: "133.333% auto" },
  ],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>About | Ryan Cross</title><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/></head>
  <body>
    <PortfolioHeader active="about"/>
    <main class="about-main">
      <h1 class="photo-name" aria-label="ryan">
        {nameWords.map(word => <span class="photo-name-word" aria-hidden="true">{word.map(({ letter, photo, position, size }) => <span class="photo-name-letter" style={`background-image:url('/images/about-name-${photo}.jpg');background-position:${position};background-size:${size}`}>{letter}</span>)}</span>)}
      </h1>
      <div class="about-layout">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <p>Hi there, my name is Ryan and I am so glad you found my portfolio!</p>
          <p><strong>Academia:</strong> In the spring of 2027, I will earn my M.S. degree in Aerospace Engineering with a focus in Fluids, Structures, and Materials from CU Boulder. During my time as an undergrad, I participated in the Engineering Honors Program, various student clubs, and earned my Certificate in Engineering Leadership.</p>
          <p><strong>Career:</strong> My pursuit to become an aerospace engineer developed from two sources: the movie <em>Hidden Figures</em>, and my first visit to the Steven F. Udvar-Hazy Center&mdash;my favorite air and space museum. Since then, I have taken on a variety of internship and research opportunities to expand my technical abilities and explore where my aerospace interests lie.</p>
          <p><strong>Hobbies:</strong> I enjoy staying active through running, hiking, swimming, skiing, and playing Ultimate Frisbee. With my free time, I am learning the guitar, watching movies, and going on walks. Every morning I love to make an espresso, experimenting with different beans, flavors, and latte art.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-photos">
          <img src="/images/about-museum-optimized.jpg" alt="Ryan at an air and space museum surrounded by aircraft" width="5712" height="4284"/>
          <img src="/images/about-hike-optimized.jpg" alt="Ryan hiking above a mountain lake" width="6048" height="4011" loading="lazy"/>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="about-contact" aria-labelledby="about-contact-title">
        <h2 id="about-contact-title">contact me</h2>
        <form id="about-contact-form">
          <div class="about-contact-fields">
            <label for="contact-name">name<input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
            <label for="contact-email">email<input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
          </div>
          <label for="contact-message">message<textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea></label>
          <div class="about-contact-actions"><button type="submit">send</button><p>Opens your email app with your message ready to send.</p></div>
        </form>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script>
      document.querySelector('#about-contact-form')?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
        event.preventDefault();
        const form = event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;
        const data = new FormData(form);
        const subject = encodeURIComponent(`Portfolio message from ${data.get('name')}`);
        const body = encodeURIComponent(`Name: ${data.get('name')}\nEmail: ${data.get('email')}\n\n${data.get('message')}`);
        window.location.href = `mailto:ryanc31415@gmail.com?subject=${subject}&body=${body}`;
      });
    </script>
    <PortfolioFooter/>
    <CloudflareAnalytics/>
  </body>
</html>
